Jishu's great — oh, truly great;
Jishu's bright — oh, really bright!
Our wooden steed — yes, made of wood — runs a thousand miles outright!
Cogs spin nonstop — whirr, whirr, whirr — even Lord Argent gawks in awe!
Jishu's good — so good, so fine;
clever, crafty — top of the line!
Come join us now — come one, come all;
life turns easy — easy and light!
Free and breezy — ee-ee-ee, yeah-yeah-yeah!

— Gongshang Shuo

"Ah! How magnificent are the Nine Chapters of Dafeng!
When chaos first gave way, the Nine Chapters were set in place;
By the covenant of the two divine lords, the standard was forged;
The Argent Loong upheld the law, and inscribed the righteous way;
High it stands, vast and unshaken — never to be toppled!
...
Great indeed — great indeed!"

Marginal note, in another hand: The opening and closing are predictably trite, and the middle offers nothing worth keeping. Rewrite.
